{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】上水警署懷疑有警員吞槍身亡。</p>\n<p>事發後有救護車在場。據了解，一名交通部的39歲男警員早上在上水警署的洗手間內吞槍，其後昏迷倒臥。救護員到場後，證實男警當場死亡。</p>\n<p>警方表示，事件於早上十時多發生，懷疑與槍械有關，正調查起因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:22:38.698945+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:03:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:16:06.766065+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:16:06.766065+00:00","content_hash":"ce21e8ca3a61678b550ce3b86ff85461e53e7e53473c969f401717924a2ff1dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}